/*
 * TODO:
 * - Axis Routing OnMapLoad to not go through broken wall?
 * - Find a way to more aggressively defend without TK... - Should be enough
 * - Ammo_Crates_Planted/Defused should be handled - See if previous changes are enough with HH bot difficulty config - Yes
 * - When Church Ruins spawn is the only one available and the whole team spawns, they all go the ladder way and hinder each other...
 *   * Added routing, helped
 *   * Port the spawn exit management from my other maps?
 *     * Would penalize bots going for other routes, would take some tight waypointing, perhaps someday
 *
 * - Cover/Detonate spot(s)
 * - Stuckages
